                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                                    <div class="fw-bold text-primary mb-1">Step 3</div>
                                    <div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-1">Add Custom HTML Block</div>
                                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0" style="font-size:0.78rem;">Click the <strong>(+) Add Block</strong> icon in WordPress and select <strong>Custom HTML</strong>.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 border h-100">
                                    <div class="fw-bold text-primary mb-1">Step 4</div>
                                    <div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-1">Paste &amp; Publish</div>
                                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0" style="font-size:0.78rem;"><strong>Paste</strong> the copied HTML code into the block and click <strong>Update / Publish</strong>.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success rounded-3 border border-success border-opacity-25 mt-3 small">
